      <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;The invoice becomes invalid. It keeps its number, and can not be changed, deleted or sent any more. This can not be undone.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If the customer already received the invoice, it must be cancelled or corrected with a new document instead.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
